  "content": "<h1>Luminax</h1><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmaven.satherov.dev%252f%2523%252freleases%252fdev%252fsatherov%252fluminax%252fluminax\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/maven-metadata/v?metadataUrl=https://maven.satherov.dev/releases/dev/satherov/luminax/luminax/maven-metadata.xml&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;label=Maven&amp;logo=apachemaven&amp;color=C71A36\" alt=\"Maven\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crystalix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1165932?style=for-the-badge&amp;label=Downloads&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;color=F16436\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/SathLabs/Luminax\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-Luminax-181717?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a></p><p>這個非常簡單的模組為遊戲添加了少量單色方塊。</p><p>你可以使用<strong>Luminax 魔杖</strong>來修改方塊的顏色和光照強度。</p><p><strong>鑲框方塊 (Framed Blocks)</strong> 也完全支援。</p><p>目前包含的方塊有：</p><ul>\n<li>完整方塊</li>\n<li>半磚</li>\n<li>階梯</li>\n<li>牆</li>\n<li>壓力板</li>\n<li>按鈕</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1165932/description_dd30c320-85da-4f1d-b44d-88991e3b097c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
